Package: positionR
Title: Tools for Acoustic Telemetry Studies
Version: 2.0.0
Authors@R:
    person("Jacob", "Brownscombe", , "jakebrownscombe@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-2496-8764"))
Description: Installs the four packages of the positionR suite for
    acoustic telemetry studies: 'detqc' reads, checks and filters detections;
    'detfield' builds detection fields and positions animals; 'arraydesign'
    designs receiver arrays and tests the performance of tracking systems; and
    'arraydesignR' runs 'arraydesign' as a point-and-click application. Lists
    the four packages with their roles, installed versions and documentation
    sites. It does not attach them.
License: GPL (>= 3)
URL: https://jakebrownscombe.github.io/positionR/,
